---
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-blue via-brand-mid to-brand-deep text-white">
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-accent via-brand-orange to-brand-accent"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-4 inline-flex rounded-full border border-brand-accent/50 bg-brand-accent/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-orange">
          Senior Microsoft-konsulenttjenester
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-black leading-tight sm:text-5xl">
          Sikker, moderne og effektiv Microsoft-plattform – levert av erfarne konsulenter.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base text-slate-200 sm:text-lg">
          Vi hjelper virksomheter med å bygge sikre, moderne og effektive Microsoft-miljøer – fra strategi og arkitektur til implementering, migrering og videreutvikling.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#kontakt" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-orange hover:text-brand-blue">
            Book en uforpliktende prat
          </a>
          <a href="#tjenester" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-white/30 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10">
            Se våre tjenester
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-brand-accent/40 bg-white/10 p-6 backdrop-blur">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full bg-brand-accent"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Kjerneområder</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 text-sm text-slate-100 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex-shrink-0"></span>Microsoft Entra ID</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex-shrink-0"></span>Microsoft Intune</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex-shrink-0"></span>Microsoft 365</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex-shrink-0"></span>Active Directory & Hybrid identity</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex-shrink-0"></span>Conditional Access & Zero Trust</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex-shrink-0"></span>Autopilot & Defender</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex-shrink-0"></span>Exchange Online, SharePoint, Teams</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex-shrink-0"></span>AVD, Windows 365, PowerShell</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
